silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_07_sections_02_concrete_anchor_3#longrundiagram silm:hasLongDescription "The LongRunDiagram is the long-run object. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'colim_n D_Mittens^n', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
